flowchart TD
    Start["Start"] --> AI_Dialer
    AI_Dialer["AI Dialer Initialization"] --> |Fetch customer data from CRM| FetchData{"Fetch Data"}
    FetchData --> |Fetch successful| VerifyHours["Verify call time is within 8 AM to 5 PM"]
    VerifyHours --> |Within allowed hours| MakeCall["Initiate Call"]
    MakeCall --> |Call connected| HandleInteraction["Handle Customer Interaction"]
    MakeCall --> |Call fails| RetryCall["Retry Call (Up to 3 times)"]
    RetryCall --> |Retries exhausted| RecordFail["Record Call as Failed"]
    RecordFail --> End["End"]
    HandleInteraction --> |Customer accepts offer| TransferToAgent["Transfer to Human Agent"]
    HandleInteraction --> |Customer declines repeatedly| RecordDecline["Record Declined Deal"]
    HandleInteraction --> |Customer has doubts/questions| UseRAG["Consult RAG System"]
    TransferToAgent --> End
    RecordDecline --> End
    UseRAG --> HandleInteraction
    End["End"]